/* =========================================================
   MULTI-CURRENCY FOUNDATION (Phase 1)
   - ONE FX engine / ONE conversion path: convertAmt(amount, from, to).
     Base/reference currency = USD. The market-prices edge function caches USD<CCY>=X
     (units of CCY per 1 USD), so any pair is  amount / perUsd[from] * perUsd[to]
     (no 11x11 pair table). from === to is a strict identity (no rounding, no drift).
   - Transactions and accounts keep their ORIGINAL currency + amount (finance_transactions.currency/amount,
     finance_accounts.currency/balance). A transaction's account impact is frozen at creation in
     finance_transactions.account_amount (account currency), so editing/deleting reverses the exact impact.
   - Everything downstream (totals, budget, health, analytics, reports, Revi) still consumes IDR-base numbers.
     The conversion happens ONCE, at the boundary (normTx / normAccount in FinanceApp), never inside those calcs.
   - Everything else that is still stored in IDR (debts, goals, budgets...) is shown in the Display Currency via fmtIDR().
   ========================================================= */
